			<h1 class="im-projecthero-title">Im Design System</h1>
			<p class="im-projecthero-text">Tokens, a page shell, forty components and ready-made sections for Ghost themes — written from a blank file, so everything in it is yours to sell on.</p>
			<p class="im-repo-topics">
				<a class="im-topic" href="#">Tailwind 4</a>
